@MovieStoreApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7166

### 1. Get all (should show your 2 seeded movies)
GET {{MovieStoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies

### 2. Create (the Id of the new movie is saved automatically)
# @name createMovie
POST {{MovieStoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Title": "Interstellar",
  "Price": 14.99,
  "Genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "Director": "Christopher Nolan"
}

### 3. Get one (uses the Id from request 2)
GET {{MovieStoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/{{createMovie.response.body.$.Id}}

### 4. Update (expect 204)
PUT {{MovieStoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/{{createMovie.response.body.$.Id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Title": "Interstellar (Director's Cut)",
  "Price": 16.99,
  "Genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "Director": "Christopher Nolan"
}

### 5. Get all again (Interstellar should show the new title)
GET {{MovieStoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies

### 6. Delete (expect 204)
DELETE {{MovieStoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/movies/{{createMovie.response.body.$.Id}}